id: pm-jev-option-contract-1114
title: Adopt pm-cli option contract and current pm-toolchain
description: Supersede Dependabot PR 114; retain evaluation prerequisite and gate expectation refusals under normalized host options.
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[3]: dependencies,"gh:unbraind/pm-jev#114","gh:unbraind/pm-jev#115"
