author: codex-toolchain-1114a
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-14T11:04:03.024Z",codex-toolchain-1114a,"Failure -> cause -> fix: gate expects booleans to refuse -> GH-1665 CLI string normalization -> add true/false to the exact must-allow verdict corpus and replace malformed-input refusal coverage with 1/0 strings and null, preserving case/empty refusals, exit 2, no HTTP calls and unchanged tracker bytes. Evaluation expects invalid-task refusal with missing required from -> shared declared-flag host preflight now refuses missing from first -> test that refusal separately (message plus exit 2), supply from for each handler-owned invalid-task case, and add extension_option_spelling_conflict code/exit/no-write assertions. Neither measured failure requires changing the GH-1704 secret-guard fixtures. No production source or threshold change. Two diagnostic candidates are recorded without filing: missing required flags have no stable error.code; the harness forwards unknown options although the CLI refuses them. The latter matches the public normalizer declaration, so it is a parity/design candidate, not a claimed undocumented change."
  "2026-11-14T11:08:06.443Z",codex-toolchain-1114a,"Final linked affected files pass 21/21 with zero failures, cancellations or skips (70 seconds), including both original failures, source/destination no-write checks and zero inference on refusals. npm/Bun typecheck, build:test, lint, 0% duplication at unchanged 0%, and docstrings (1130 declarations) pass. Original upgraded-pin baseline failed 2/2 reported cases; restoring its boolean refusal and missing-from invalid-task assumptions reproduces those failures. The two synthetic diagnostics were verified: required from refusal has exit 2 without error.code; unknown option succeeds in the minimal harness but the native CLI refuses it with unknown_option exit 2. Full npm/Bun release checks remain queued serially at unchanged coverage thresholds; no live provider tests are enabled."
  "2026-11-14T12:51:12.656Z",codex-toolchain-1114a,"Complete local release evidence for source commit c777a5eae1e545530a111247fbacc78180892423: npm run release:check and bun run release:check both exit 0, each with 461 passing tests and zero failures, cancellations or skips. All reported statement, branch, function and line coverage dimensions are 100%, at unchanged thresholds. Typecheck, lint, 0% duplication, docstrings, provenance/identity checks, audit, pack inspection, changelog and release attestation all pass. Earlier source-head CI is queued at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jev/actions/runs/43588611360. This evidence-only commit waits for the shared-runner hold before publication. Live-provider tests remain disabled. The item is released and remains in progress for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-11-14T14:56:26.885Z",codex-toolchain-1114a,"Failure | Cause (host contract) | Fix\n--- | --- | ---\nevaluation validation rejects bad flags, hosted providers and private-only data | Shared declared-flag preflight checks required from before handler-owned task validation. | Assert missing-source expected-error/message/exit 2 separately, supply from for invalid-task cases, and assert extension_option_spelling_conflict exit 2 before inference or writes. The missing required-option code is an unfiled diagnostic candidate.\ngate expectations distinguish unsafe secrets, clean text and inclusive boundaries | GH-1665: boolean expect values normalize to the valid true/false strings. | Add exact verdict tuples for both booleans; retain invalid string/null refusals with expected-error and exit 2, zero HTTP calls and unchanged tracker bytes. GH-1704 did not cause these measured failures.\n\nContract reference: [pm-cli 2026.11.8 migration entries](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md#2026118---2026-11-08). Full gate results and timing limits are recorded in the preceding validation receipts. No workload or coverage threshold was lowered. This final comment makes the failure/cause/fix mapping explicit; source files are unchanged."
